name: sim.setAutoYieldDelay
description: Allows specifying a thread interruption or yield delay, that will be automatically enforced by the system (preemptive threading). By default this value is 2 ms
luaSynopsis: sim.setAutoYieldDelay(float dt)
pythonSynopsis: sim.setAutoYieldDelay(float dt)
inputs:
1. dt: desired execution time, before an interruption or yield occurs
outputs:
replacedBy:
- name: autoYieldDelay, class: detachedScript, file: detachedScript_autoYieldDelay.property
